{"id":"5c8c56808857d2df","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound.md","title":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","display":"thm-context-free-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","73-thm-context-free-pumping-lemma"],"display":"thm-context-free-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound</span><span>73-thm-context-free-pumping-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-context-free-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7505f1b37c6f6f74\" href=\"?note=7505f1b37c6f6f74\" title=\"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion\">73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p\\to\n\\exists u,v,x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=uvxyz\\land |vxy|\\leq p\\land |vy|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(uv^ixy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p\\to\n\\exists u,v,x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=uvxyz\\land |vxy|\\leq p\\land |vy|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(uv^ixy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Put a grammar for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> in CNF. A sufficiently tall parse tree repeats a nonterminal on one root-to-leaf path; the two occurrences delimit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>CNF bounds the yield below the repeated upper node, giving <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|vxy|\\leq p\">\\(|vxy|\\leq p\\)</span>, while distinct repeated levels ensure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|vy|\\geq1\">\\(|vy|\\geq1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free language, see [[73-df-cfg-language-class]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\,\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p\\to\n\\exists u,v,x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=uvxyz\\land |vxy|\\leq p\\land |vy|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(uv^ixy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"|vxy|\\leq p","display":false},{"tex":"|vy|\\geq1","display":false}],"bytes":1177,"backlinks":[{"id":"edb85b0ac6775cd2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["83639a9615c06195","7505f1b37c6f6f74"]}